WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.212
- Night, night.

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.591
- Jayson. Jayson!

00:00:08.842 --> 00:00:10.802
Jayson! Focus!

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:12.429
It’s finally reached BeanTown.

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:15.056
The announcement from old man Silver everyone’s been talking about.

00:00:15.056 --> 00:00:18.184
[Heraldic instrumentals]
- As the sun sets on the great LeBron,

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:21.855
the time has come to find a new face of our league.

00:00:21.855 --> 00:00:24.816
Which one of you will prove your worth?

00:00:24.816 --> 00:00:27.152
- Hey, you know who’d be a wicked good face of the league?

00:00:27.152 --> 00:00:28.820
Modern-day Larry Bird.

00:00:28.820 --> 00:00:30.488
- Oh, yeah, yeah, yeah.
-  Yes, sir!
- Wicked pissah.

00:00:30.488 --> 00:00:32.532
- [Jaylen Brown:] How quickly they forget about us.
- [Jayson Tatum:] How quickly they forget about me.

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:35.785
- You?! Being selfish won't win us a ring of influence.

00:00:35.785 --> 00:00:37.537
- You're only saying that because we—

00:00:37.537 --> 00:00:39.998
- Got embarrassed. [Chuckling]

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:41.041
- It’s a troll.

00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.918
- Worse...it’s a Joel.
♪♪♪

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:48.506
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:51.760
♪♪♪  Riaru-sa misetayo ♪♪♪

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.721
♪♪♪  Born to be a legend ♪♪♪

00:00:54.721 --> 00:00:57.974
♪♪♪  Hikari o mezashite ♪♪♪

00:00:57.974 --> 00:01:04.397
♪♪♪  Born to be a hero ♪♪♪

00:01:04.856 --> 00:01:09.027
- Remember my game plan, Joel. No need to charge—
[Quickening footfalls]

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.365
[Exploding]

00:01:14.365 --> 00:01:15.700
- Spacing.
[Quickening footfalls]

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:16.201
[Fighting]

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:25.919
- Bill Simmons shouldn't get an MVP vote.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:28.338
- A trash-talker!

00:01:28.338 --> 00:01:30.840
I thought there weren’t many of his kind left.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:32.217
Jayson, I need you to—

00:01:32.217 --> 00:01:35.095
- Oh, no. Embiid got in his head!

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.180
- [Chuckling]

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.932
Rent-free.

00:01:41.935 --> 00:01:43.269
- If I took him out,

00:01:43.269 --> 00:01:45.522
I could be the face of the league. Imagine:

00:01:45.522 --> 00:01:47.065
[Quickening footfalls]
every man, woman and child

00:01:47.065 --> 00:01:49.150
wearing a Jaylen Brown jerse—
[Gasping]

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:52.737
[Metal on metal screeching]
The Traveler.

00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:57.492
Maybe I'm not...him. Jayson—

00:01:57.492 --> 00:02:00.203
you're HIM. It's your team!

00:02:00.203 --> 00:02:07.168
Be selfish. Be selfish…
[Electric sizzling]

00:02:13.842 --> 00:02:15.552
- I haven't seen this in years.

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:17.804
It’s Mamba Mode! Stop him!

00:02:19.639 --> 00:02:21.141
Goodbye, traveler.

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:25.061
One day you won't disappear when we all need you.

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:27.397
[Crash of hard landing]

00:02:27.397 --> 00:02:31.901
- I can’t lose. I’m the best center in the league!

00:02:34.154 --> 00:02:37.198
- Too bad it's a Wings League now.
[Screeching]

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.286
- Come back, Jimmy!

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:49.961
[Thud]
- I told you to take out that blimp.

00:02:49.961 --> 00:02:52.422
- Hey, look, I didn’t shoot a powerball, like, all summer.

00:02:52.422 --> 00:02:56.467
- Gentlemen, we WILL remain the face of the game.

00:02:57.051 --> 00:02:59.679
- But we must do everything we can

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.763
to stop them.

00:03:01.598 --> 00:03:03.766
Leave no stone unturned.

00:03:04.392 --> 00:03:06.603
Before they become

00:03:06.603 --> 00:03:07.937
too powerful.

00:03:10.273 --> 00:03:12.483
[Triumphant music]

00:03:12.483 --> 00:03:14.235
- [Grunting]

00:03:14.235 --> 00:03:17.030
I'm back...on...top!

00:03:20.366 --> 00:03:22.285
[Sun shuriken whirring]
[Splashing, sizzling]

00:03:22.285 --> 00:03:25.413
- OK, you've had your shot. It's my time now.

00:03:25.413 --> 00:03:28.708
- Luka?! If anyone's taking the
MVP idol from Jokic,

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.543
it's the winner of last year's one seed.
[Chiming]

00:03:30.793 --> 00:03:33.546
- And how'd that work out for you? Huh?
[Fire igniting and water swirling]

00:03:33.546 --> 00:03:36.549
[Fire igniting and water swirling]
[Laughing]

00:03:36.549 --> 00:03:38.676
[Thundering]

00:03:38.676 --> 00:03:39.260
- Wow!

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:42.597
The wonders of this strange land
never cease to amaze!

00:03:43.681 --> 00:03:45.391
[Crashing]

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:48.228
You guys coming?

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:53.858
[Steady footsteps]

00:03:53.858 --> 00:03:57.695
[Giannis:] Ah, man. Jokic does everything for 
1.6-Kilometer-High City.

00:03:57.695 --> 00:04:03.076
- This is why an elite fighter like you—
or me—must stop him from getting a third idol.

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:05.203
- Oh. So you're on Giannis's level now?

00:04:05.203 --> 00:04:07.205
- [Luka]: Hahaha. OK.

00:04:09.123 --> 00:04:12.377
[Whooshing]

00:04:12.377 --> 00:04:15.088
- This is the closest I've been to a real trophy.

00:04:15.088 --> 00:04:18.424
- Don’t! Jokic’s MVPs are rigged!
[Earth rumbling]

00:04:18.424 --> 00:04:21.010
- [Luka and Devin]: Ahh!
- [Giannis]: Whee!

00:04:22.637 --> 00:04:25.598
Oh. Another Giannis wall.

00:04:25.598 --> 00:04:27.183
[Dribbling]

00:04:27.183 --> 00:04:30.895
[Fire igniting]
- Point God, show me the way.

00:04:30.895 --> 00:04:32.438
[Quickening footfalls]
[Gasp] Chris?

00:04:32.438 --> 00:04:33.481
[Footfalls fading]

00:04:33.481 --> 00:04:35.149
[Sigh] Deandre?

00:04:35.149 --> 00:04:38.945
[Water dripping]
- Ah, well. I am used to being alone.

00:04:38.945 --> 00:04:41.823
- [Menacing laughing]
- He's...here.

00:04:42.115 --> 00:04:43.449
[Striking dynamite fuse]
- Hello.

00:04:43.449 --> 00:04:44.033
- [Screaming]

00:04:46.286 --> 00:04:47.954
- Here we go.
[Hook whirring]

00:04:51.457 --> 00:04:54.502
[Steady footsteps]

00:04:54.502 --> 00:04:57.088
- Stop hiding the MVP away in the mountains!

00:04:57.088 --> 00:05:00.216
It belongs in a bigger market!

00:05:00.675 --> 00:05:02.719
- Are we really doubling in open combat?

00:05:02.719 --> 00:05:05.013
- Almost ready.
[Hook still whirring]

00:05:05.555 --> 00:05:08.725
- I have many weapons in my arsenal.

00:05:08.725 --> 00:05:11.477
[Dynamite sizzling and exploding]

00:05:13.396 --> 00:05:14.814
[Warping]

00:05:14.814 --> 00:05:17.525
- Ow! In the back? Who does that?

00:05:20.486 --> 00:05:22.947
[Brand sizzling]

00:05:22.947 --> 00:05:24.282
- Wet.

00:05:25.116 --> 00:05:25.908
[Hammer thudding]

00:05:29.078 --> 00:05:31.080
[To himself] He can sense where I am without looking. 

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:32.832
I don't know if I can beat him without help.

00:05:32.832 --> 00:05:36.085
[Earth bursting]
- [Powerful echoing] I am here for the idol.

00:05:36.085 --> 00:05:38.546
Aye, man. This place is very nice!

00:05:42.508 --> 00:05:45.345
[Water swirling]
- Ahhh!

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:48.097
- I will not be cooled off!

00:05:48.931 --> 00:05:49.766
[Hammer thuds]

00:05:50.350 --> 00:05:51.684
[Bursting]

00:05:52.518 --> 00:05:54.103
- Goodbye!

00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:59.817
- You had one job, Joker.
The Association's displeased.

00:05:59.817 --> 00:06:01.361
[Nuggets whooshing]

00:06:01.361 --> 00:06:04.113
[Chuckling] You know I live online.

00:06:05.490 --> 00:06:13.414
Channel your rage at stopping these targets.
[Suspenseful music]

00:06:13.414 --> 00:06:15.249
- Hmm.

00:06:15.666 --> 00:06:18.628
[Joyful, playful music]

00:06:19.796 --> 00:06:22.965
[Chill music]

00:06:22.965 --> 00:06:24.175
- Ja!
- Hey, it’s Ja!

00:06:24.175 --> 00:06:25.885
- Best out of his draft class!

00:06:25.885 --> 00:06:27.178
- Oh, and Dillon Brooks!

00:06:27.178 --> 00:06:30.640
- Man, I haven't seen Grit City this happy 
since we switched Gasols.

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:33.851
- Hopefully I can be a good face 
of the league for everyone.

00:06:33.851 --> 00:06:35.269
[Siren buzzing]
[Townspeople panicking]

00:06:35.269 --> 00:06:36.813
- What’s going on?

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.567
[Earth rumbling]

00:06:41.567 --> 00:06:43.111
- Z...Zion!

00:06:43.111 --> 00:06:45.530
- ROARRRR!

00:06:45.530 --> 00:06:49.158
- [Dillon Brooks:] He’s got a new body.
[Evil laughing]

00:06:51.661 --> 00:06:56.040
- ROAR!
- [Townsperson:] Oh, no! A titan with clothes on! Run!

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:57.500
- ROARRR!

00:06:58.835 --> 00:07:01.712
-[Ja to himself:] Why is everyone so excited about Zion?

00:07:01.712 --> 00:07:04.006
He hasn't really done any-
- ROAR!

00:07:04.006 --> 00:07:06.759
- Dillon, get the Gritizens to safety!

00:07:10.388 --> 00:07:13.099
[Ja to himself:] According to the overly detailed 
diagram in my head,

00:07:13.099 --> 00:07:16.102
nothing can stop Zion once he gets 
through the perimeter.

00:07:17.979 --> 00:07:20.815
- Don't worry. There's strength in numbers.

00:07:30.741 --> 00:07:31.701
[Zion evil laughing]

00:07:31.701 --> 00:07:34.662
- I still remember your weakness.

00:07:35.872 --> 00:07:37.039
[Zion groaning]

00:07:37.373 --> 00:07:38.082
[Gasps]

00:07:38.082 --> 00:07:39.876
Even his kicks have changed!

00:07:40.001 --> 00:07:42.462
Time to get flashy.

00:07:44.755 --> 00:07:46.799
[Zion groaning]

00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:48.968
The Association! It’s controlling him!

00:07:48.968 --> 00:07:50.761
- ROARRRRR!

00:07:50.761 --> 00:07:53.306
- Zion! It’s not just you against me!

00:07:53.306 --> 00:07:54.682
This is bigger than that.

00:07:54.682 --> 00:07:56.350
Remember the code!

00:07:58.603 --> 00:08:01.731
- [Young Ja:] Zion, let’s promise to always be best friends.

00:08:01.731 --> 00:08:05.067
- [Young Zion:] Promise! Now let’s go destroy 
some fellow children.

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.778
[Shoes malfunctioning]

00:08:10.990 --> 00:08:13.409
- The...code...

00:08:18.539 --> 00:08:21.250
Spoiler alert: I was in there the whole time.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:23.794
Whew.

00:08:23.794 --> 00:08:26.380
Thanks, bro. They really tried to pit us against each other.

00:08:26.380 --> 00:08:29.133
- Those old heads stay controlling the narrative.

00:08:29.133 --> 00:08:30.885
- We gotta fight back.

00:08:31.093 --> 00:08:32.261
Follow me.

00:08:38.184 --> 00:08:41.103
[Tense music]

00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:46.359
- Once Ja and Zion take each other out,

00:08:46.359 --> 00:08:48.736
nothing will be in our way.

00:08:48.736 --> 00:08:50.279
- [Chuckling] Yeah, nothing.

00:08:56.494 --> 00:09:00.706
[Steady footsteps]

00:09:00.706 --> 00:09:04.877
- Are we sure we want to activate...him?

00:09:04.877 --> 00:09:07.880
- The Association headquarters are in The Holly Woods.

00:09:07.880 --> 00:09:09.715
So we attack them where it hurts.

00:09:09.715 --> 00:09:11.050
[Machine-like sounds]

00:09:13.636 --> 00:09:16.180
[Upbeat music]

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:19.767
- [Charles Barkley:] The rising young stars are finally 
fighting the old heads.

00:09:19.767 --> 00:09:24.021
They're even taking down some legends from 
within their own ranks.

00:09:24.021 --> 00:09:29.277
There's no doubt a new class of heroes has risen up.

00:09:29.277 --> 00:09:33.573
And ain't no way LeBron and those bus riders 
taking out them kids.

00:09:33.573 --> 00:09:35.032
Take them out to dinner maybe.

00:09:35.032 --> 00:09:37.410
- Look at you. Already talking about food.

00:09:37.410 --> 00:09:39.120
- I know you not talking!

00:09:39.120 --> 00:09:40.871
All you talk about is barbecue chicken!

00:09:40.871 --> 00:09:42.290
- At least I got rings.

00:09:42.582 --> 00:09:43.332
- Ahhhhh!

00:09:45.334 --> 00:09:48.879
- Thank you to the Salt Lakes for welcoming us to All-Hero Weekend.

00:09:48.879 --> 00:09:52.258
As a special treat, taverns will be open till 8 p.m.

00:09:52.258 --> 00:09:54.010
- I've never got so many cheers!

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.386
I'm so excited.

00:09:55.761 --> 00:09:56.762
- Why's Steph here?

00:09:56.762 --> 00:09:58.889
Everyone knows I was brought in to replace him.

00:10:01.017 --> 00:10:02.685
- He thinks he can replace me.

00:10:03.060 --> 00:10:03.644
Cute.

00:10:03.644 --> 00:10:04.520
[Growling]

00:10:04.520 --> 00:10:07.440
- Look, LeBron's courting the second-hottest young guard.

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:09.108
[Whispering]

00:10:09.108 --> 00:10:11.444
- But King, you already have DLo.

00:10:11.444 --> 00:10:14.822
- LeBron, step away from the impressionable young star.

00:10:14.822 --> 00:10:18.951
- Thanks, Dame. I almost had to go to a place 
with pressure and expectations.

00:10:19.243 --> 00:10:21.537
- I've battled too many superteams.

00:10:21.537 --> 00:10:23.372
Some less super than others.

00:10:23.372 --> 00:10:27.877
And I vow no superteams will form this All-Hero Weekend.

00:10:27.877 --> 00:10:29.629
- Not this loyalty s--t again.

00:10:42.892 --> 00:10:44.560
[Saxophone Rat squeaks]

00:10:45.061 --> 00:10:45.561
- Hmm.

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:50.691
- I've used it many times, it's never failed me.

00:10:50.691 --> 00:10:54.695
- LeBron! Aw, did I ruin another one of your trades?

00:10:54.695 --> 00:10:58.783
- [Chuckling] Maybe it's me, or maybe it's you.

00:10:58.783 --> 00:11:01.577
- [Groaning] [Wall crumbles]

00:11:02.453 --> 00:11:03.954
- I know you think you clutch.

00:11:05.081 --> 00:11:06.707
I'll show you clutch.

00:11:07.083 --> 00:11:09.001
- Dame, calm down.

00:11:09.001 --> 00:11:10.586
You're not supposed to activate it.

00:11:10.586 --> 00:11:12.630
Not at All-Hero Weekend.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.049
- [Announcer:] Welcome back to the celebrity All-Hero game.

00:11:15.049 --> 00:11:17.218
Post Malone struggles down the court, and-

00:11:17.218 --> 00:11:18.552
[Energy burst]

00:11:18.552 --> 00:11:19.553
- Oh, nice beam.

00:11:22.056 --> 00:11:24.433
- It's... Dame Time.

00:11:24.433 --> 00:11:26.394
May God have mercy on us all.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:30.815
[Whispering]

00:11:30.815 --> 00:11:33.651
- [Dame:] No. More. Hand covering mouth...

00:11:33.651 --> 00:11:35.486
[Energy charging]
Whispering things!

00:11:36.195 --> 00:11:38.197
Bombs away! [Blasting]

00:11:38.197 --> 00:11:39.323
- [Grunting]

00:11:40.825 --> 00:11:42.576
[Muffled explosions]
I knew this would happen.

00:11:42.576 --> 00:11:44.578
Before I came here, I knew this would happen.

00:11:44.829 --> 00:11:46.330
- [Echoing] Sixteen bars.

00:11:51.001 --> 00:11:53.587
[Wooshing]
- Dame, you're right about superteams.

00:11:53.921 --> 00:11:56.590
Everyone should follow the old ways of heartbreaking losses.

00:11:57.508 --> 00:11:58.634
- Heh.

00:11:58.634 --> 00:11:59.552
[Glass shattering]
- Hah!

00:11:59.552 --> 00:12:01.053
[Sand cascading]

00:12:01.053 --> 00:12:02.346
- Sorry, Dame.

00:12:02.346 --> 00:12:03.848
You were destroying the Salt Lakes,

00:12:03.848 --> 00:12:05.725
And none of us wanna be part of that rebuild.

00:12:05.725 --> 00:12:07.435
[Crowd cheering]

00:12:08.269 --> 00:12:09.478
- [Announcer:] Wow!

00:12:09.478 --> 00:12:11.397
Best All-Hero Weekend yet.

00:12:12.106 --> 00:12:13.858
- Nice bag of tricks you got there.

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:15.735
- Woah, careful. No superteams.

00:12:15.735 --> 00:12:17.486
[Laughing]

00:12:19.363 --> 00:12:21.240
- [LeBron:] I've used it many times,

00:12:21.240 --> 00:12:22.366
It's never failed me.

00:12:26.078 --> 00:12:27.830
- All hail the Beam.

00:12:28.414 --> 00:12:30.458
All hail the Beam.

00:12:30.458 --> 00:12:32.251
- You may be benched.

00:12:32.251 --> 00:12:34.003
Worshipers of the Beam,

00:12:34.003 --> 00:12:37.965
it has been my pleasure to shepherd in a triumphant new era,

00:12:37.965 --> 00:12:41.761
where, with every victory, the Beam grows stronger.

00:12:41.761 --> 00:12:43.512
- All hail the Beam.

00:12:43.512 --> 00:12:46.807
- Tonight, we shall summon the Almighty Beam,

00:12:46.807 --> 00:12:50.519
allowing us to blot out the Western sky with its beauty.

00:12:50.519 --> 00:12:54.857
Never again will Sac Town be thrust back into darkness.

00:12:54.857 --> 00:12:56.233
[Alarm buzzing]

00:12:56.233 --> 00:12:57.401
An intruder!

00:12:58.444 --> 00:12:59.987
It can’t be...

00:13:00.321 --> 00:13:03.282
- The prodigal son has returned!

00:13:03.282 --> 00:13:04.658
Tyrese!

00:13:04.658 --> 00:13:07.203
- I’ve come to shut off that damn Beam!

00:13:19.381 --> 00:13:20.800
[Phone ringing]

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:23.928
- [Hield:] You ready for that sweet revenge?

00:13:23.928 --> 00:13:25.971
- [Haliburton:] I’m just focused on passing right now.

00:13:26.305 --> 00:13:27.306
But yes!

00:13:34.063 --> 00:13:35.147
- Brother Haliburton!

00:13:35.523 --> 00:13:37.107
Have you come to embrace the Beam?

00:13:40.945 --> 00:13:42.238
That’s rude.

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:42.988
Very well.

00:13:42.988 --> 00:13:46.116
- Beam, grant us the power of the pistol offense.

00:13:49.453 --> 00:13:50.704
Dang corner shooters.

00:13:52.164 --> 00:13:52.957
Buddy!

00:13:56.919 --> 00:13:59.463
- Haha! No one shoots faster than me.

00:14:03.676 --> 00:14:05.427
- Wait, I'm new.

00:14:05.427 --> 00:14:07.137
I don't know what I'm doing!

00:14:09.306 --> 00:14:10.850
- I'm getting too old for this.

00:14:12.518 --> 00:14:13.811
I’m too young for this!

00:14:15.187 --> 00:14:17.898
- Nothing like homemade Red Velvet.

00:14:25.489 --> 00:14:29.076
- Now we summon the Almighty Beam.

00:14:29.368 --> 00:14:30.703
- [Haliburton:] You’re in my spot.

00:14:30.703 --> 00:14:32.037
- It’s Haliburton. Run!

00:14:33.539 --> 00:14:36.208
- There are no spots in the eyes of the Beam.

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:36.792
[Gong]

00:14:39.211 --> 00:14:41.463
- Look into the Beam, Tyrese!

00:14:41.463 --> 00:14:42.172
- Never!

00:14:42.464 --> 00:14:43.090
[Beeping]

00:14:44.049 --> 00:14:44.842
- [Fox:] No!

00:14:59.857 --> 00:15:00.816
- Yo.

00:15:00.816 --> 00:15:02.902
- The...Beam?

00:15:02.902 --> 00:15:04.653
- I go by many names.

00:15:04.653 --> 00:15:06.572
Some call me the Almighty Beam.

00:15:06.572 --> 00:15:08.616
Some call me stupid and ironic.

00:15:09.617 --> 00:15:11.243
I hear you've come to destroy me.

00:15:11.243 --> 00:15:11.952
Why?

00:15:11.952 --> 00:15:14.872
- I...wanted revenge for being cast out...

00:15:14.872 --> 00:15:17.207
and to prove to everyone I’m not a fake hero.

00:15:17.207 --> 00:15:19.418
- Wally Szczerbiak is everyone now?

00:15:20.794 --> 00:15:22.546
You were a hero here.

00:15:22.546 --> 00:15:25.090
And you are a hero in Indiana-opolis.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:28.802
Just because the beam shines doesn't mean you don't shine.

00:15:28.802 --> 00:15:32.014
You need to...find your own beam.

00:15:32.014 --> 00:15:34.016
- Find my own beam.

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:37.645
[Ringing]

00:15:37.645 --> 00:15:39.897
- [Hield:] You ready for that sweet revenge?

00:15:40.439 --> 00:15:42.274
Where are you going?

00:15:42.942 --> 00:15:44.652
- That’s someone else’s problem.

00:15:44.652 --> 00:15:46.320
Let’s find our own beam.

00:15:47.321 --> 00:15:49.573
- I was not expecting that answer to be that deep.

00:15:49.573 --> 00:15:50.491
You good, bro?

00:16:00.542 --> 00:16:02.628
- The Beam from the north is too powerful!

00:16:02.628 --> 00:16:05.130
We must offer up a sacrifice to protect the cap!

00:16:08.509 --> 00:16:10.469
- Oh, whoa! Whoa! Wait!

00:16:14.556 --> 00:16:16.934
Collapse? There is no collapse!

00:16:21.689 --> 00:16:22.773
We can make this work!

00:16:22.773 --> 00:16:24.400
Just shoot us an opening, Ben.

00:16:25.192 --> 00:16:27.486
-I...I...can't.

00:16:30.614 --> 00:16:32.491
-I figured this moment would come.

00:16:32.491 --> 00:16:34.201
-You figured this moment would come?!

00:16:34.201 --> 00:16:35.077
You brought me here!

00:16:35.452 --> 00:16:37.663
-I did what I was supposed to do.

00:16:37.663 --> 00:16:38.539
-Kyrie, no!

00:16:39.164 --> 00:16:41.291
Don’t leave me with these scrubs!

00:16:42.543 --> 00:16:45.129
-Luckily, you were able to join this superteam, right?

00:16:45.129 --> 00:16:47.214
-So is this like, ya'll's downtown or...?

00:16:47.214 --> 00:16:49.550
-No, this is the Nash Path.

00:16:49.550 --> 00:16:51.468
The quickest way to the tournament.

00:16:51.468 --> 00:16:53.804
And where I can finally beat...him.

00:16:55.055 --> 00:16:56.265
-That’s them, all right.

00:16:56.265 --> 00:16:57.891
Luka’s carrying all the weight.

00:16:57.891 --> 00:16:59.143
Attack!

00:16:59.143 --> 00:17:00.019
-Look out!

00:17:02.521 --> 00:17:04.440
-Oh, phew. It's just the Suns.

00:17:04.440 --> 00:17:05.899
Thought it was refs.

00:17:05.899 --> 00:17:06.525
Thank you.

00:17:07.651 --> 00:17:08.277
-Wait...

00:17:10.029 --> 00:17:11.071
It’s Kyrie.

00:17:11.697 --> 00:17:14.241
And he’s actually planning on participating!

00:17:18.328 --> 00:17:20.539
-Kevin, you must relax.

00:17:20.539 --> 00:17:23.000
-Relax?! There is no relax, champ.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.334
I’m on 10!

00:17:26.795 --> 00:17:28.589
-OK, what's the game plan?

00:17:28.589 --> 00:17:30.382
-Look, I'm not the savior here.

00:17:30.382 --> 00:17:31.675
I’m watching just like everyone else.

00:17:35.512 --> 00:17:37.347
-Good thing it's just my sons.

00:17:37.347 --> 00:17:38.599
Hello, Book!

00:17:38.599 --> 00:17:40.100
It’s Daddy Luka!

00:17:42.478 --> 00:17:44.772
-Totally legitimate Warriors rings: GO!
[Rings flash]

00:17:44.772 --> 00:17:47.357
[Water crashes]

00:17:47.357 --> 00:17:51.487
[Energy balls blast]

00:17:51.820 --> 00:17:54.114
-Hey! Y'all are shooting more than me.

00:17:54.114 --> 00:17:55.657
-[sigh] Deandre...

00:17:55.657 --> 00:17:58.160
-Not fair! I don’t wanna be here! Hmph!

00:17:59.703 --> 00:18:02.122
-Looks like the odds are...even.

00:18:02.122 --> 00:18:04.166
-Ugh! You and your numbers!

00:18:04.166 --> 00:18:05.959
-Too hot...
[Energy ball whirrs]

00:18:05.959 --> 00:18:06.752
TO HANDLES!

00:18:06.752 --> 00:18:07.252
[Energy ball explodes]

00:18:07.252 --> 00:18:07.836
[Energy ball explodes]
-Ooh!

00:18:07.836 --> 00:18:09.421
-Illegal powerball.

00:18:09.421 --> 00:18:10.923
He took three steps!

00:18:10.923 --> 00:18:12.007
Doesn’t count!
[Voice echoes]

00:18:12.007 --> 00:18:14.551
[Record rewinding]

00:18:14.551 --> 00:18:16.303
-Man...snitch.

00:18:16.303 --> 00:18:17.805
-Well, I’ve done my role.

00:18:17.805 --> 00:18:20.265
[Guitar sting]

00:18:21.975 --> 00:18:24.770
-Come on, Russ. I mean, Steph. I mean, Kyrie. I mean, Book.

00:18:26.146 --> 00:18:27.272
-You handle Kevin.

00:18:27.272 --> 00:18:28.190
I’ve got this!

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:28.816
[Screaming]

00:18:28.816 --> 00:18:30.734
-Isolation Chamber!

00:18:32.319 --> 00:18:33.570
[Punching noises]
-You started it!

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.197
-No! You started it!

00:18:35.197 --> 00:18:36.365
-Ow, my groin!

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:39.284
-I can’t believe what you said.

00:18:39.284 --> 00:18:41.328
-You’ll have to be more specific.

00:18:41.328 --> 00:18:43.831
-You said you “did what you were supposed to do.”

00:18:43.831 --> 00:18:46.291
Did that include betraying your best friend?

00:18:48.085 --> 00:18:49.211
You don’t have to answer.

00:18:49.211 --> 00:18:50.587
Your silence speaks volumes.

00:18:50.587 --> 00:18:51.964
Easy Money Mid-Range!

00:18:51.964 --> 00:18:52.756
[Energy barrage blasting]

00:18:52.756 --> 00:18:54.133
-Invisible Defender!

00:18:56.802 --> 00:19:00.430
[Both yelling]

00:19:01.140 --> 00:19:06.603
[Somber violin]

00:19:06.603 --> 00:19:07.479
-Kyrie, no!

00:19:07.855 --> 00:19:09.523
Don’t leave me with these scrubs!

00:19:18.240 --> 00:19:19.658
-[Yelling] Huh?

00:19:19.658 --> 00:19:20.742
-Don’t you see?

00:19:21.160 --> 00:19:22.202
I saved you.

00:19:22.202 --> 00:19:24.163
I saved you because...

00:19:24.746 --> 00:19:26.957
I may wanna join the Suns next year.

00:19:26.957 --> 00:19:28.250
-No, Kyrie.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.376
Not again.

00:19:29.376 --> 00:19:31.211
I mean, well...maybe?

00:19:31.211 --> 00:19:32.337
If you—but, no.

00:19:32.337 --> 00:19:33.005
-Come on.

00:19:33.005 --> 00:19:35.507
For some reason the Mavs have been terrible since I got here.

00:19:35.507 --> 00:19:36.758
-I mean, yeah, but...

00:19:36.758 --> 00:19:37.342
-What? Um...

00:19:37.342 --> 00:19:38.302
-[Laughing]

00:19:38.302 --> 00:19:41.138
While they focus on their little rivalry,

00:19:41.138 --> 00:19:45.142
the No. 1 seed can go straight to Playoff Mountain.

00:19:51.648 --> 00:19:54.193
- Wooo! Knicks take Playoff Mountain!

00:19:54.193 --> 00:19:58.488
- We’re going from the base camp to our face on a stamp, jueard!

00:19:58.488 --> 00:20:01.533
- Bing bong! Yeah! We still do that!

00:20:01.783 --> 00:20:05.162
- Hello! It’s your cool dad, Adam Silver.

00:20:05.162 --> 00:20:08.540
Welcome to the Eastern Face of Playoff Mountain!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.792
Each team will traverse their own path,

00:20:10.792 --> 00:20:13.045
finding opponents on their way to the summit,

00:20:13.045 --> 00:20:16.381
where the champion will take on the best of the Western Face.

00:20:16.381 --> 00:20:19.384
Please, make your way to your assigned path.

00:20:19.384 --> 00:20:21.762
- Hell yeah! I'm hype! Let's go!

00:20:21.762 --> 00:20:22.596
-Ahhh!

00:20:22.596 --> 00:20:26.600
-Chill, bro. The strongest heroes of the East Lands are all here.

00:20:27.517 --> 00:20:28.644
[laughing]

00:20:31.521 --> 00:20:32.105
[beep]

00:20:32.105 --> 00:20:32.940
[beep]
- On your mark...

00:20:32.940 --> 00:20:34.233
get set... 
[beep]

00:20:34.233 --> 00:20:35.692
Ball!
[starting tone]

00:20:37.027 --> 00:20:37.861
- Slow down!

00:20:37.861 --> 00:20:40.280
If we get lost I'm gonna get blamed and sent away!

00:20:40.280 --> 00:20:42.241
Relax, I was brought here to guide you.

00:20:42.241 --> 00:20:43.825
I think we need to go–

00:20:43.825 --> 00:20:46.703
- I'm doing things my way! Rahhhh!

00:20:46.703 --> 00:20:47.913
- [sigh]

00:20:51.041 --> 00:20:53.794
- M-m-m-maybe, maybe we should turn around.

00:20:53.794 --> 00:20:55.212
- Paul George writes that everywhere.

00:20:55.212 --> 00:20:57.047
Let's find our first opponent.

00:20:58.298 --> 00:20:59.508
- Come out and fight!

00:20:59.925 --> 00:21:01.134
Looks like we got a bye.

00:21:01.760 --> 00:21:03.303
- Uh...

00:21:04.805 --> 00:21:06.098
Uh, guys?

00:21:06.098 --> 00:21:06.640
- Huh?

00:21:08.767 --> 00:21:11.979
- Looks like the only thing stopping us from playoff success...

00:21:11.979 --> 00:21:13.105
is ourselves!

00:21:13.105 --> 00:21:14.189
- [RJ:] Ahh!

00:21:17.818 --> 00:21:19.236
[shrill laughter]

00:21:19.236 --> 00:21:21.321
- All right, here’s what we do.

00:21:21.321 --> 00:21:23.323
I take out all three of them! Rah!!

00:21:23.323 --> 00:21:24.658
- Julius! Slow down the pace!

00:21:25.117 --> 00:21:26.243
- Necessary spin move!

00:21:26.576 --> 00:21:28.036
- Unnecessary spin move!

00:21:31.081 --> 00:21:33.125
- The Shadow Knicks have all our moves,

00:21:33.125 --> 00:21:34.334
including our flaws.

00:21:34.334 --> 00:21:35.210
Which means

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:37.879
Shadow RJ shouldn’t be able to shoot from there!

00:21:37.879 --> 00:21:40.257
- Hey! Not true!
- Hey! Not true!

00:21:40.257 --> 00:21:42.134
[power blast]

00:21:42.134 --> 00:21:43.593
[power charging]

00:21:43.593 --> 00:21:44.845
[power blast]

00:21:44.845 --> 00:21:46.471
- W-w-whoa!

00:21:46.471 --> 00:21:47.597
- Careful!

00:21:47.597 --> 00:21:48.807
Spikes!

00:21:48.807 --> 00:21:50.100
- I’ve put up with a lot,

00:21:50.100 --> 00:21:53.061
but this is the Knicks team that finally breaks me!

00:21:54.938 --> 00:21:56.481
- Every year it’s something.

00:21:56.481 --> 00:21:58.442
- I knew we shouldn't have given up on Reddish!

00:21:58.442 --> 00:22:01.028
- Maybe New York is a Nets town?

00:22:01.403 --> 00:22:02.654
- Too...far.

00:22:02.904 --> 00:22:03.697
- [evil laughter]

00:22:03.697 --> 00:22:04.281
- [grunt]

00:22:06.033 --> 00:22:08.869
- You’re...under...sized!

00:22:08.869 --> 00:22:12.581
- I’m the same height as Donovan Mitchell!

00:22:14.041 --> 00:22:17.085
-[Evil laughter] You can’t defeat us!

00:22:17.085 --> 00:22:18.628
We’re the Knicks!

00:22:18.628 --> 00:22:20.672
We’re already defeated!

00:22:20.672 --> 00:22:22.507
- And we by far...

00:22:22.507 --> 00:22:24.468
- have more demons...

00:22:24.468 --> 00:22:26.928
- than anyone else here!

00:22:26.928 --> 00:22:29.473
Playoff pressure!

00:22:29.473 --> 00:22:32.601
- Too...much...pressure...

00:22:32.601 --> 00:22:33.727
I’m out.

00:22:33.727 --> 00:22:36.646
- [Evil laughter] Collapsing in crunch time?

00:22:36.646 --> 00:22:39.524
The Knicks are so predictable.

00:22:40.108 --> 00:22:42.319
- Predictable? These Knicks?

00:22:42.319 --> 00:22:43.904
Haha! Now Julius!

00:22:45.280 --> 00:22:46.323
- Jump...

00:22:46.907 --> 00:22:47.574
pass!

00:22:48.116 --> 00:22:48.825
- Haha!

00:22:48.825 --> 00:22:50.369
- [groaning]

00:22:50.369 --> 00:22:52.245
He left his feet! That should never work!

00:22:52.245 --> 00:22:55.374
You can’t escape me forever!

00:22:55.374 --> 00:22:57.918
I have facial recognition software!

00:22:57.918 --> 00:22:58.919
[blast]

00:22:58.919 --> 00:23:00.670
- Looks like your plan worked.

00:23:01.046 --> 00:23:02.964
- All we needed was some heart.

00:23:03.131 --> 00:23:04.257
- Sorry I’m late.

00:23:04.841 --> 00:23:05.967
- En garde!

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:08.428
Ah! It's just the Knicks.

00:23:08.845 --> 00:23:10.305
This should be an easy fight.

00:23:10.305 --> 00:23:13.183
- Trust us, it’s harder than you think.

00:23:14.101 --> 00:23:16.686
- Who will reach the top of Playoff Mountain

00:23:16.686 --> 00:23:20.190
and lay claim to the new face of the league?

00:23:20.190 --> 00:23:21.108
- Hell if I know.

00:23:21.108 --> 00:23:24.319
I just know they get paid a hell of a lot more than when I was a hero.

00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:27.030
Also my playoff prediction:

00:23:27.030 --> 00:23:30.492
Wizards and the great Bradley Beal win it all.

00:23:30.492 --> 00:23:31.576
- Shut up, Chuck!

00:23:31.576 --> 00:23:32.828
I’m trying to wrap up the season!

00:23:32.828 --> 00:23:34.413
- Uh oh! Rebound!

00:23:34.413 --> 00:23:36.957
- Ahh! Not the face! My endorsements!

00:23:41.962 --> 00:23:44.089
- [Narrator:] Once every generation...

00:23:45.090 --> 00:23:47.175
a new star arrives.

00:23:50.720 --> 00:23:53.473
- [Spaceship:] Undesirable destination confirmed.

00:23:53.765 --> 00:23:56.268
- [Laughing] C'est super.

00:23:58.228 --> 00:24:00.564
- [Narrator:] And everyone prepares for him.

00:24:00.564 --> 00:24:02.774
- Shaquillum O'Nealus!

00:24:03.942 --> 00:24:05.694
- [Narrator:] He can turn another young star

00:24:06.278 --> 00:24:07.737
into a second fiddle.

00:24:11.908 --> 00:24:13.285
He can build somethin'

00:24:13.285 --> 00:24:16.288
out of all those bricks you've been pilin' up.

00:24:21.710 --> 00:24:24.212
He can restart a fanbase's engine.

00:24:31.636 --> 00:24:33.180
And finally answer...

00:24:34.389 --> 00:24:36.475
all your tough questions.

00:24:39.019 --> 00:24:42.814
He can even stop the greedy from hoardin'.

00:24:44.316 --> 00:24:46.276
And maybe,

00:24:46.276 --> 00:24:48.320
just maybe, he could stop our drought.

00:25:00.624 --> 00:25:01.833
- Bonjour!

00:25:01.833 --> 00:25:04.503
Which lucky souls has won the Wemby lottery?

00:25:04.503 --> 00:25:06.171
- [Gregg Popovich:] And if he doesn't land here...

00:25:06.171 --> 00:25:07.797
I mean, I’ll take a flier on Scoot. I don't care.

00:25:07.797 --> 00:25:09.007
I’m gonna live forever.

